    { "type": "text", "id": "t_data", "x": 546, "y": 564, "width": 558, "height": 224,
      "text": "data  [NOT public — internal only]\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────\ndev-postgres  |  uat-postgres\ndev-redis     |  uat-redis\nMinIO  (object storage)\nbackup-cronjob  (pg_dump → S3/MinIO)\n\nNetworkPolicy: dev pods → dev-db only\n              uat pods → uat-db only\n              (cross-env isolation enforced)",
      "originalText": "data  [NOT public — internal only]\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────\ndev-postgres  |  uat-postgres\ndev-redis     |  uat-redis\nMinIO  (object storage)\nbackup-cronjob  (pg_dump → S3/MinIO)\n\nNetworkPolicy: dev pods → dev-db only\n              uat pods → uat-db only\n              (cross-env isolation enforced)",
      "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
